\[\measuredangle TND = \measuredangle NHC + \measuredangle HCN = \measuredangle THA + \measuredangle ACD = 2\measuredangle ABD.\]
Finally,
\[\measuredangle TED = \measuredangle TEA - \measuredangle DEA = (180^\circ - \measuredangle AHT) - \measuredangle DBA = 180^\circ - 2\measuredangle DBA = 2\measuredangle ABD,\]
