\end{align*}
Thus, we have proven that  $4(ab+bc+ca) + 4\min(a^2,b^2,c^2)\geq (a+b+c)^2$ , and subtracting  $2(ab+bc+ca)$  from both sides derives the desired inequality.  $\blacksquare$ .

