It follows that   $$ \left[P\widehat{A_6A_7}\right]=\frac18-\frac1{2\sqrt2}+[PA_6A_7]=\frac18+\frac1{2\sqrt2}-[PA_2A_3]=\frac18-\frac{\sqrt2}{504}, $$  and the answer is  $\boxed{504}$ .</details>

