\begin{align*}
f(x) + x-1 & \mid x^2 + (x-1) f(x) 
\implies f(x) + x-1 & \mid 2x-1.
\end{align*}
Since we already showed that  $f(x) \geq x$ , it follows that  $f(x) = x$ , as desired.

