<span style="color:#f00">**Claim 1:**</span> Carl can draw the perpendicular bisector of any chord  $\overline{AB}$  of  $\omega$ [asy]
size(6cm);
pair A=(7.76,1.48);
pair B=(15.196429620360057,1.5990461124301159);
pair C=(6.3685098294922105,-0.9114229107566338);
pair D=(10.05444993479033,2.8299068927268523);
pair D1=(12.859946485499774,2.8748186951439227);
