Hence, we must have  $a_1^{2018} + a_2 \leq a_1 + 1$ , but  $a_1^{2018} > a_1$  and  $a_2 > 1$  (since  $a_1 \equiv a_2 \equiv 4 \pmod{5}$ ). This is a contradiction, so we are done.  $\Box$

